Media Integrity Analyzer

Day 33 – 60 Days AI Challenge

Media Integrity Analyzer is a premium single-file HTML application that teaches media literacy through interactive discovery instead of traditional quizzes.

Features

- 🎯 Guided learning before every challenge
- 📰 Headline Detective
- ❤️ Emotion Detector
- 📊 Live Media Integrity Metrics
- 📈 Overall Media Integrity Dashboard
- 🔄 Replay with completely new scenarios
- 🌙 Premium editorial-style dark interface
- 🎨 Theme selection (including Claude Orange)
- 📱 Fully responsive design
- ⚡ Built with pure HTML, CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript
- 🌐 Works completely offline
- 📄 No external libraries, frameworks, APIs, or assets

Learning Outcomes

Users learn how to:

- Identify misleading headlines
- Detect emotional manipulation
- Evaluate source reliability
- Understand audience targeting
- Build practical media literacy habits

Tech Stack

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript

